{'symbol': 'TECH', 'date': '2021-08-05 06:30:00', 'title': 'BIO-TECHNE RELEASES FOURTH QUARTER FISCAL 2021 RESULTS', 'text': 'MINNEAPOLIS, AUG. 5, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0BIO-TECHNE CORPORATION (NASDAQ:TECH) TODAY REPORTED ITS FINANCIAL RESULTS FOR THE FOURTH QUARTER ENDED JUNE 30, 2021. FOURTH QUARTER FY2021 SNAPSHOT FOURTH QUARTER ORGANIC REVENUE INCREASED BY 39% (47% REPORTED) TO $259.0 MILLION.'}